<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ProfileIdentifierType/simpleLicensing> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ProfileIdentifierType> .
<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/ark> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "[Archival Resource Key (ARK)](https://arks.org/about/), is a Uniform Resource Identifier (URI) suited to being a persistent identifier for information objects of any type, standardized by the [ARK Identifier Scheme](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-kunze-ark/) Internet-Draft. It consists of the \"ark:\" label followed by a Name Assigning Authority Number, a forward slash, a name, and an optional qualifier (e.g., `ark:12148/btv1b8449691v/f29`)."@en .
